---
import Algo from '@/components/mascot/Algo.tsx';
import { url } from '@/data/curriculum';
---
<footer class="site-footer" data-pagefind-ignore>
  <div class="container footer-inner">
    <div class="footer-brand">
      <Algo size={46} mood="wink" />
      <div>
        <strong class="footer-title">AIology</strong>
        <p>그림으로 보고, 손으로 만지며 배우는 인공지능 교과서.<br />직선 하나를 긋는 기계에서 GPT·확산 모델·에이전트까지.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <nav class="footer-links" aria-label="바닥글 메뉴">
      <div>
        <span class="footer-head">배우기</span>
        <a href={url('/book/')}>책 (28장)</a>
        <a href={url('/playground/')}>시각화 실험실</a>
        <a href={url('/map/')}>학습 지도</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="footer-head">연습하기</span>
        <a href={url('/practice/')}>코드랩 (20편)</a>
        <a href={url('/review/')}>복습 퀴즈</a>
        <a href={url('/glossary/')}>용어 사전</a>
      </div>
      <div>
        <span class="footer-head">만든 사람</span>
        <a href="https://github.com/llouis0622" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">llouis0622</a>
        <a href="https://github.com/llouis0622/AI" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub 저장소</a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </div>
  <p class="footer-note">학습 기록은 이 브라우저에만 저장돼요 · © AIology</p>
</footer>

<style>
  .site-footer {
    margin-top: 96px;
    padding: 48px 0 28px;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg-2) 60%, transparent);
  }

  .footer-inner {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 36px;
  }

  .footer-brand {
    display: flex;
    gap: 14px;
    max-width: 380px;
  }

  .footer-brand p {
    margin: 6px 0 0;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.7;
  }

  .footer-title {
    font-size: 20px;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
  }

  .footer-links {
    display: flex;
    gap: 48px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .footer-links div {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 14px;
  }

  .footer-links a {
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .footer-links a:hover {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .footer-head {
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--text-3);
    letter-spacing: 0.02em;
  }

  .footer-note {
    margin: 36px 0 0;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--text-3);
    font-size: 13px;
  }
</style>
